@startuml 35-publication-lifecycle
' Agent-team F1r3sky publication lifecycle.
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E1D5E7
  BorderColor #294C60
}

title F1r3sky publication lifecycle

[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Published : publish\n(create app-password + putRecord)
Published --> PublishedStale : underlying content changes
PublishedStale --> Published : reconcile (re-putRecord)
Published --> Unpublished : unpublish\n(remove the record, KEEP the account)
PublishedStale --> Unpublished : unpublish
Unpublished --> Published : re-publish
Unpublished --> [*]

note bottom
  Unpublish removes the PDS record but keeps the account, so re-publishing
  is always possible. The full state set is model-checked in the reveal/
  publication lifecycle CTL model (formal T10).
end note
@enduml
